  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "This <b>Network Interactable Spawner</b> displays a preview and spawns a Network Interactable assigned in the Network Interactable Spawner (script) component.\n\nThe <b>Network Interactable Spawner</b> prefab has the following <b>Preview Settings</b>: \n<i>*Gizmos must be enabled</i>\n   \xB7<b>Mesh Preview</b>- This checkbox allows for a preview of the object that will be spawned. With additional UI to choose the specific meshes you wish to preview.\n   \xB7<b>Show Spawn Distance Gizmo</b>- Visually represents the distance the object needs to move in order to spawn a new one.\n\n<b>*</b>The <b>Network Interactable Spawner (script)</b> component provides an Inspector interface to easily update and visualize all referenced objects and properties. It also provides a <b>Spawn Transform</b> reference to define the position where the object's spawn point will be placed in the scene."
